### Список документов, типы и локали
POST {{baseUrl}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "query": "query DocumentLists { documents { __typename id type_id type translit created_at updated_at } documentTypes documentLocales }"
}

### Список документов
POST {{baseUrl}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "query": "query Documents { documents { __typename id type_id type translit created_at updated_at } }"
}

### Список типов документов
POST {{baseUrl}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "query": "query DocumentTypes { documentTypes }"
}

### Список локалей документов
POST {{baseUrl}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "query": "query DocumentLocales { documentLocales }"
}

### Все контенты документа
POST {{baseUrl}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "query": "query DocumentContents($id: Int!) { documentContents(document_id: $id) { id doc_id lang_id doc_content created_at updated_at } }",
  "variables": { "id": 1 }
}

### Контент документа по локали
POST {{baseUrl}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "query": "query DocumentContent($id: Int!, $locale: LocaleCode!) { documentContent(document_id: $id, locale: $locale) { id doc_id lang_id doc_content created_at updated_at } }",
  "variables": { "id": 1, "locale": "ru" }
}
